  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">List-I</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">List-II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Spring constant</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">B</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Angular speed</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">II</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">C</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Angular momentum</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">III</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">D</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Moment of Inertia</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">IV</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
