  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The formula to calculate the spring constant is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>The formula to calculate the angular speed is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>The formula to calculate the angular momentum is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>The formula to calculate the moment of inertia is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Use the method of dimensional analysis to obtain the dimensions of the required quantities. From above relations, we can write</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>L</mi></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#969;</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>T</mi></mfenced></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>L</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>L</mi></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>I</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>"
